     5307   _temp-fin-sum:
     5308   for each buf_temp-fin-sum no-lock
     5309     by buf_temp-fin-sum.tot-sum descending
     5310     on error  undo _main, return error substitute( "&1. &2&3&4", vss-workfile, return-value, chr(10), error-status :get-message (1))
     5311     on stop   undo _main, return error substitute( "&1. stop", vss-workfile )
     5312     on endkey undo _main, return error substitute( "&1. endkey", vss-workfile )
     5313     :
     5314     empty temp-table tt0-fin-doc-tax.
     5315     empty temp-table tt0-fin-doc-attr.
